 * doubts (the user asked for these on 2026-11-27). Sunni scholars only; every entry names its sources.
 * [ids] are HadeethEnc ids: the sharh page of those ids shows the note and the extended sharh.
 * Entries with no HadeethEnc page carry their own [hadith] text and open on their own page.
 * The list page «أحاديث يُشكل فهمها» (More › تعلّم, and the sharh home) shows them all.
 * Also: «للاستزادة» links that search the same hadith on Dorar, IslamWeb and IslamQA in the browser.
 */
